{"4503910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Circus Survival", "steam_appid": 4503910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/ceae071cd5d42cc81c1cb509d8209410.avif?t=1787908436\" width=872 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive a brutal circus death-run where one mistake sends you flying into chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A popup ad promised $1,000,000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You clicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you’re trapped in a deadly game show where every jump, every step, and every second could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/bc42b10bd558c75ee6c500aac8908488.avif?t=1787908436\" width=822 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section of the course introduces new dangers that test your timing, precision, and nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a deadly gauntlet of traps including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swinging <strong>pendulum balls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotating <strong>gauntlet crushers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrow <strong>pipeline traversal</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spike traps</strong> ready to punish every mistake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision platforming jumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapsing pathways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly <strong>mines and sniper fire</strong> in the final hallway</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step matters. One mistake can send you falling into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/0f654d1609d696704ec61d5e5c3f9187.poster.avif?t=1787908436\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/0f654d1609d696704ec61d5e5c3f9187.webm?t=1787908436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/0f654d1609d696704ec61d5e5c3f9187.mp4?t=1787908436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/d5e3a8ba8406bc5b5db1e48be7e09552.avif?t=1787908436\" width=822 height=184 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When things go wrong, they go <strong>very wrong</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters react with dynamic <strong>ragdoll physics</strong>, turning every hit, fall, and trap into unpredictable moments of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get launched by a hammer, thrown by a pendulum, or blasted off the course — the environment doesn't forgive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/a0df6e12ab329b7bc254ca9c55ac0094.poster.avif?t=1787908436\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/a0df6e12ab329b7bc254ca9c55ac0094.webm?t=1787908436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/a0df6e12ab329b7bc254ca9c55ac0094.mp4?t=1787908436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/c645bcbbc77c11b27829f7e72e99013e.avif?t=1787908436\" width=822 height=184 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circus Survival</strong> isn't just a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charismatic announcer watches your every move, reacting to your successes and failures as you struggle through the course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you impress the audience… <br>or become the next spectacular failure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/49ebad9d140a6d8060bd851f7c92cc87.poster.avif?t=1787908436\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/49ebad9d140a6d8060bd851f7c92cc87.webm?t=1787908436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/49ebad9d140a6d8060bd851f7c92cc87.mp4?t=1787908436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4503910/extras/13e2702fa45ee2b3af2e784a6c9e793c.avif?t=1787908436\" width=822 height=184 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most determined challengers will survive the course and claim the <strong>$1,000,000 prize</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far can you make it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im